00:07:25.153 --> 00:07:26.033
as a simple split.

00:07:26.653 --> 00:07:30.873
Parabolic flights and drop towers often charge thousands of dollars per kilogram.

00:07:31.453 --> 00:07:35.553
Keep the height down and the vehicle is a flying heat shield with a lab tucked behind

00:07:35.553 --> 00:07:35.833
