00:07:48.773 --> 00:07:53.293
Keep the payload powered for the whole stay and investigators can close the loop on temperature,

00:07:53.913 --> 00:07:59.213
agitation, or nutrient flow while samples are still forming, so bus electricity and a little

00:07:59.213 --> 00:08:02.093
